# The build context is only used for the docker/ files in the published
# Dockerfile (the source is cloned from the public repository inside the
# build); keep the context small and free of local state when building
# from a development tree. The Makefiles of tmp/ and var/ are part of the
# source and must stay.
.git
etc/Site.conf
*.log
TODO*
tmp/*
var/*
!var/Makefile
